A ditch made it disappear.

4
00:00:06,082 --> 00:00:07,430
It was called Lake George.

5
00:00:07,660 --> 00:00:09,550
It lay between Dyer, Hartsdale and

6
00:00:09,560 --> 00:00:11,556
Schererville, with swamp around it.

7
00:00:12,006 --> 00:00:14,208
Aaron Hart, a former Philadelphia book

8
00:00:14,218 --> 00:00:16,208
